# SSNN Spiking Vitality & Electrical Impulse Effects - Implementation Plan

This plan details the design, architecture, and step-by-step tasks required to make the Spiking and Sounding Neural Network (SSNN) spiking visualizer and synthesis engines feel more alive with explosive shocks, lightning-bolt connection arcs, and electrical impulse sounds.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Performance Safety vs. Aesthetic Density:**
> Drawing 27,900 synaptic connections at 60Hz would choke the UI. We will implement a threshold gate (only drawing connections with weights `> 0.6` originating from active spiking neurons) to render beautiful, lightweight branching path lines.
> 
> **Auto-Disposable Audio Nodes:**
> Adding noise generators to the synth voices increases the number of concurrent nodes. We will implement strict cleanup timers using `window.setTimeout` to disconnect and dispose of all transient nodes, preventing memory leaks.

## Open Questions

