## Proposed Changes

### 1. Visual Spiking Grid (Canvas-based Particles & Lightning Arcs)
Modify [SSNNSynthesizer.tsx](file:///d:/Proyectos/StrudelAI-main/StrudelAI-main/src/components/SSNNSynthesizer.tsx):
- **Lightning Synaptic Arcs:** Draw branching lines between layer transitions `L -> L+1` when a pre-synaptic neuron spikes, introducing slight organic offsets (jagged lightning pathing) and opacity scaling with synaptic weights.
- **Explosive Shockwaves:** Implement expanding ring animations centered at the coordinates of any neuron that fires a spike in the current frame.
- **Electrical Impulse Sparks:** Implement a lightweight particle simulation ref (`sparksRef`) tracking tiny sparks that eject outward from spiking nodes and decay over a few frames.

### 2. Audio Synthesis (Static Discharge & Shocks)
Modify [dsp.ts](file:///d:/Proyectos/StrudelAI-main/StrudelAI-main/src/lib/ssnn/dsp.ts):
- **Static Discharge (Pulse Engine):** Introduce a parallel high-pass filtered white noise burst transient (5ms duration) playing at the attack stage of the pulse voice, simulating a relay contact spark or capacitor discharge tick.
- **Explosive Metallic Shocks (Comb Engine):** Increase the excitation noise impulse amplitude and add waveshaped saturation to give the feedback delay resonator a clashing, distorted electric shock tone.
- **Mallet Excitation Click (Modal Engine):** Add a sharp initial transient tick to the Modal sweeps to give wood mallets an explosive strike.

